{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（25日）是台灣光復81周年，也是大陸設立台灣光復紀念日一周年。</p><p>央視新聞發布「吉林一號」衛星影像俯瞰台灣，標記「這是中國台灣省」，影片從台灣島空拍畫面延伸至台北中正紀念堂、故宮、台北大巨蛋、台北港等地標。</p><p>［央視微博片段］</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:07.934924+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:09.066285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798271+00:00","content_hash":"9540d82dd04e96334b832473801ec7c2d6f278fc22748acf34d507d999f4489e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}